{'symbol': 'FOX', 'date': '2023-02-28 11:34:00', 'title': 'FOX WEATHER EXPANDS DISTRIBUTION', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FOX WEATHER, FOX NEWS MEDIA'S FREE AD-SUPPORTED STREAMING TELEVISION (“FAST”) WEATHER SERVICE, HAS EXPANDED ITS DISTRIBUTION TO INCLUDE OPTIMUM, SPECTRUM AND LG CHANNELS ANNOUNCED SHARRI BERG, ITS PRESIDENT. IN MAKING THE ANNOUNCEMENT, BERG SAID, “FOX WEATHER HAS NOW BECOME A DESTINATION FOR VIEWERS ACROSS MANY MAJOR PROVIDERS WITH THIS EXPANDED DISTRIBUTION. I AM INCREDIBLY PROUD OF AMERICA'S WEATHER TEAM AS WE CONTINUE TO EXPAND OUR BEST-IN-CLASS WEATHER SERVICE."}